{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"忠实平坦环同态"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"忠实平坦环同态"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>忠实平坦环同态是"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦景","text":"平坦覆盖"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称环同态 $A\\to B$ 忠实平坦, 是指\n$$\r\n{-}\\otimes B\\colon B\\mathsf {Mod}\\to A\\mathsf {Mod}\r\n$$\n全忠实且正合.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦环同态","text":"平坦环同态"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}